<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Highveld details capitalisation award.</title>
<headline>Highveld details capitalisation award.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Highveld Steel and Vanadium Corp Ltd said on Monday it would offer capitalisation shares on the basis of the ratio that 21.5 cents bears to the average share price in the three days to April 10.</p>
<p>Registration date for the issue is March 14. Shareholders may elect to receive an interim cash dividend of 20 cents per share for the year ended December 31 1996 instead, the group said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
